{"id": "t160-002", "text": "Coffee with Andre. His sister Zara got engaged on Saturday, proposal on a beach in Portugal apparently. Wedding probably next summer. He's chuffed for her but dreading the best man-ish speech he's been roped into. His mum keeps phoning him with ideas. We said we'd meet for a run next Tuesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chuffed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "best man-ish speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "run", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t160-005", "text": "Kate and Patrick's anniversary is Friday. Six years. Kate keeps saying Patrick would love a decent coffee grinder, worth remembering for Christmas too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "would love a decent coffee grinder", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}]}
{"id": "t160-017", "text": "Saw Siddharth at the station. His brother Nikhil is getting married in Pune on December 12th and the whole family's going for a fortnight. Sid's never been to India in winter. Told him I'd look after his cat Biscuit while they're away. Need to get a spare key off him before the 10th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikhil", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Pune", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sid", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a spare key off him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the 10th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t160-018", "text": "Naledi's little boy started nursery this week and has cried every morning. She's exhausted and back at work full time on the 3rd. Remind me to drop round with dinner one evening next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boy", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work full time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round with dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "one evening next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t160-022", "text": "Catch up with Ellie and Jen. Ellie's mum got the all clear from her scan on Monday, massive relief. Jen's moving to Bristol in a fortnight with her girlfriend Kate. We're doing a leaving meal Thursday the 18th. Need to book the table at Dishoom tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "all clear", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "massive relief", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p5"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving meal", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday the 18th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the table at Dishoom", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t160-023", "text": "Patrick's dog Rolo has his op tomorrow morning, Patrick's a wreck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a wreck", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t160-026", "text": "Moira's daughter Chioma, Chi to everyone, is getting married in October. Moira says Chi's fiancé Amir is lovely but his family are a lot. The engagement party is May 30th at their house. I'm bringing a cake. Moira's also got her sister staying with her till Friday, so the house is chaos.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiancé", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p6"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p6"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 30th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till Friday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t160-031", "text": "Long walk with Alina. She's been struggling since the miscarriage in August and only told a few people. Her husband Louis has been great but he's back travelling for work next week. She mentioned she's started pottery on Wednesday nights which helps. Her sister Anya is coming to stay for the weekend of the 21st. I want to check in on Tuesday when Louis has gone, maybe suggest a walk.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "miscarriage", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "travelling for work", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d9", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday nights"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend of the 21st", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "suggest a walk", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t160-035", "text": "Dafydd says his wife Mabel loves anything with lavender. Birthday's in May.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "lavender", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t160-038", "text": "Aoife and Siddharth celebrated ten years together last weekend, went to Dublin for it. They showed me photos of the cliffs. Aoife's mum minded the kids. Sid wants to go back for New Year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ten years together", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went to Dublin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sid", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to go back", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "New Year"}]}
{"id": "t160-039", "text": "Amir's dad is in hospital again with his chest. Amir's going down on Friday, back Monday. Remind me to ring him Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going down", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t160-043", "text": "Called Archie. His mum's funeral is next Friday at St Mary's, 2pm. He's holding it together but only just. His partner Ellie is handling most of the arrangements. I'll go. I should also send something to Ellie to say thanks for keeping me posted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Archie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "holding it together but only just", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something to Ellie to say thanks for keeping me posted", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t160-047", "text": "Leah's vegan now, and her partner Dafydd's gluten free. Keep in mind for the barbecue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "gluten free", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t160-053", "text": "Aoife's wedding anniversary is the same day as mine, June 14th. Funny coincidence.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding anniversary", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same day as mine", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 14th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t160-055", "text": "Phone call with Mum. Auntie Moira's having her knee done on August 5th, and Uncle Patrick's not great with hospitals, so Mum's going to stay with them that week. Mum also said cousin Jess is engaged, to a guy called Florin. Florin's apparently a chef. I need to ring Moira the night before the op, and send Jess something nice.", "spans": [{"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Auntie Moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her knee done", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 5th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Patrick", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not great with hospitals", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay with them", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "cousin Jess", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engaged", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Florin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chef", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Moira", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before the op", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Jess something nice", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
